    <!-- ==========================================================================
         STORAGE

         WHY THERE IS NO BIGGER BACKPACK HERE
         ====================================
         A larger player backpack is the single most-felt quality-of-life change
         in this genre, and it is deliberately NOT in this mod yet.

         Backpack size lives in XUi. V3.0 did not merely rename those files - it
         changed the binding model, so a UI mod written for V2.x is a porting job
         rather than a recompile. Writing that blind, against a structure that
         cannot be inspected from here, risks the one failure mode nothing else
         in this mod has: every other patch either loads or silently no-ops,
         whereas a malformed XUi window can leave the game unusable.

         So it waits for the game files. See docs/VERIFICATION.md item 22.

         What is here instead costs nothing in risk: container capacity is plain
         block config, no XUi involved. Two tiers, priced against the production
         chain so storage is something the Long Craft pays for.

         VERIFY-22: confirm the LootSize attribute name and its cols,rows order,
         and that these container bases still exist.
         ========================================================================== -->

